2. Minimise cross‑infection risk in waiting rooms (IPC)  
3. Improve timely GP appointment access  
4. Expand community pharmacist minor‑ailment services  
5. Scale virtual wards / hospital‑at‑home  
6. Increase same‑day emergency care (SDEC) capacity  
